{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dive in the ultimate zombie experience !</strong>\u00a0Up to 4 friends, push back together or against each other zombies waves harder and harder in moving conditions thanks to <strong>mutations.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>MULTITUDE OF ZOMBIES</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face up to zombies with delusional abilities : explosion, poisoning or magic.\u00a0Show reaction and control to get rid of it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/8f5ce0cccf696cfbdfe0dbf498bc6871.poster.avif?t=1752066707\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/8f5ce0cccf696cfbdfe0dbf498bc6871.webm?t=1752066707\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/8f5ce0cccf696cfbdfe0dbf498bc6871.mp4?t=1752066707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>MUTATIONS</u></strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mutations are temporary changes to the way you play the game! From a simple damage boost to invincible zombies passing through a disco dance floor, you'll need to adapt to stay alive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/c7c5d42ec31b577350e25687b3a6521b.poster.avif?t=1752066707\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/c7c5d42ec31b577350e25687b3a6521b.webm?t=1752066707\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/c7c5d42ec31b577350e25687b3a6521b.mp4?t=1752066707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>MAPS VARIETY</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play in numerous maps : Paris, desert island, every place is good to fight !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6ba234bf52f788782307c9516a26e2dd.poster.avif?t=1752066707\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6ba234bf52f788782307c9516a26e2dd.webm?t=1752066707\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6ba234bf52f788782307c9516a26e2dd.mp4?t=1752066707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>WEAPONS VARIETY</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each round, you have the opportunity to purchase randomly selected weapons from many possible guns ! A complete arsenal to eliminate zombies !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6229f237f3e5207c6a6c3192cc3d7a39.poster.avif?t=1752066707\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6229f237f3e5207c6a6c3192cc3d7a39.webm?t=1752066707\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/6229f237f3e5207c6a6c3192cc3d7a39.mp4?t=1752066707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>GRENADES</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ignite your games with grenades with unique effects: freeze, reverse, summon... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use them to your advantage to dominate zombies and other players !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/bbe43e041dfc90ece66153da74397b40.poster.avif?t=1752066707\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/bbe43e041dfc90ece66153da74397b40.webm?t=1752066707\" type=\"video/webm\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/extras/bbe43e041dfc90ece66153da74397b40.mp4?t=1752066707\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>MULTIPLAYER</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alone or with up to 4 friends, eliminate zombies together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>COOPERATION MODE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight together to eliminate as many zombies as possible and reach the highest wave possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>VERSUS MODE</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight together but against each other to become the ultimate zombie exterminator! Who will be crowned king?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765910?t=1752066707","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3765910?t=1752066707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/8ea6164084be68525d35591491b5f4f962046705/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752066707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3765910/8ea6164084be68525d35591491b5f4f962046705/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752066707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description